      "id": "sol.amc-8-2007-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We can prime factorize \\(250\\) to get \\[ 250 = 2 \\cdot 5^3. \\] From this, we can see that \\(250\\) only has two prime factors: \\(2\\) and \\(5.\\) The sum of these is \\(7.\\)\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
